---
layout: base.njk
permalink: "picker.html"
title: "اختار لي | توريلو"
description: "محتار؟ دع توريلو يختار لك مكاناً عشوائياً من القسم الذي تحبه."
navActive: "picker"
pageScript: "picker"
langSwitchUrl: "/en/picker.html"
---
{% set pickOrder = ["restaurants", "cafes", "bakeries", "any", "stores", "places"] %}
<section class="pk" id="picker" data-step="moon">
  <div class="pk-prompt">
    <h1 id="pkTitle">إلى أين نذهب اليوم؟</h1>
    <p id="pkSub">اضغط القمر، واترك الاختيار لتوريلو.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="pk-center">
    <div class="pk-wheel" id="pkWheel" role="group" aria-labelledby="pkTitle" inert>
      {% for slug in pickOrder %}{% if slug == "any" %}<button type="button" class="pk-petal" data-section="any"><span class="pk-glyph"></span><span class="pk-petal-label">أي شيء</span></button>{% else %}{% for s in sections %}{% if s.slug == slug %}<button type="button" class="pk-petal" data-section="{{ s.slug }}"><span class="pk-glyph"></span><span class="pk-petal-label">{{ s.navLabel }}</span></button>{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
    <button type="button" class="pk-moon" id="pkMoon" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="pkWheel"><span class="pk-moon-disc"><img src="{{ '/assets/moon-paper.svg' | url }}" alt="" width="512" height="512" /></span><span class="pk-moon-label">اختار لي</span></button>
    <div class="pk-ball" id="pkBall" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  </div>
  <p class="pk-searching" id="pkSearching">نبحث لك…</p>
  <div class="pk-result" id="pkResult"></div>
  <div class="pk-tools" id="pkTools">
    <button type="button" class="pk-chip" id="pkChip">تغيير القسم</button>
    <select id="pickerArea" class="pk-area" aria-label="من أين؟"></select>
  </div>
  <p class="sr-only" id="pkLive" aria-live="polite"></p>
</section>
